        }
      },
      "body": {
        "contentType": "html",
        "content": "<p>Cooler fins were pretty bad on the exhaust side so I blew them out yesterday afternoon and restarted. Ran fine until about 01:30 then E-14. Ambient by the unit is 38C right now. Controller shows TS-2 at 113, my handheld at the discharge flange says 102.</p><attachment id=\"a1f0\"></attachment>"
      },
      "channelIdentity": {
        "teamId": "3c2f1e8a-9b7d-4e6c-a5f4-1d2e3c4b5a69",
