          "displayName": "Kenji Watanabe",
          "userIdentityType": "aadUser"
        }
      },
      "body": {
        "contentType": "html",
        "content": "<p>Ok. Read the Vastra bulletin on 5.1 (SB-2026-003). Below 5.1 a failing TS-2 shows up as E-14, so from the code alone you can't tell a dead sensor from a real overtemp. 5.1 splits them, a sensor problem comes up as E-15. 0143 is on 5.1 and hasn't done any of this.</p>"
      },
      "channelIdentity": {
        "teamId": "3c2f1e8a-9b7d-4e6c-a5f4-1d2e3c4b5a69",
        "channelId": "19:na-compressors@thread.tacv2"
      },
      "attachments": [],
      "mentions": [],
