          "userIdentityType": "aadUser"
        }
      },
      "body": {
        "contentType": "html",
        "content": "<p>And two sensors in four months on the same unit is not a bad batch. On 0142 the TS-2 harness runs along the freezer exhaust duct for about a metre and a half before it goes into the cabinet. It cooks. When you do the firmware, reroute the harness under the cable tray on the other side of the unit. I told Dave about it last year but we never got to it.</p>"
      },
      "channelIdentity": {
        "teamId": "3c2f1e8a-9b7d-4e6c-a5f4-1d2e3c4b5a69",
        "channelId": "19:na-compressors@thread.tacv2"
      },
