    },
    {
      "id": "1751400182137",
      "replyToId": "1751400174218",
      "etag": "1751400182137",
      "messageType": "message",
      "createdDateTime": "2026-07-06T20:35:00.000Z",
      "lastModifiedDateTime": "2026-07-06T20:35:00.000Z",
      "lastEditedDateTime": null,
      "deletedDateTime": null,
      "subject": null,
      "importance": "normal",
      "locale": "en-us",
      "from": {
        "application": null,
        "device": null,
        "user": {
          "id": "8f1c2a77-3b0e-4c1d-9a51-2f7e6d0b4c11",
          "displayName": "Kenji Watanabe",
          "userIdentityType": "aadUser"
        }
      },
      "body": {
        "contentType": "html",
        "content": "<p>Read the alarm log, note what the unit was doing when it tripped (load, ambient, any power dip), check the site didn't have a grid event, and put all that in the case. That saves whoever comes 30 minutes. Do not open the VFD cabinet. Request HV on the work order and the supervisor will send Daniel or me.</p>"
      },
      "channelIdentity": {
        "teamId": "3c2f1e8a-9b7d-4e6c-a5f4-1d2e3c4b5a69",
        "channelId": "19:na-compressors@thread.tacv2"
      },
      "attachments": [],
      "mentions": [],
      "reactions": [
        {
          "reactionType": "like",
          "createdDateTime": "2026-07-06T20:40:00.000Z",
          "user": {
            "user": {
              "id": "c47a0d19-6e5b-4b2a-a3f8-5d1e9c2b7a03",
              "displayName": null,
              "userIdentityType": "aadUser"
            }
          }
        }
